        "en": "Enables one designated ally character and their summon to immediately take action, and increases their DMG dealt. If the target has a summon, then the DMG dealt increase is further boosted.\nAfter using Skill on The Beatified, recovers 1 Skill Point.\nWhen Sunday uses this ability on characters following the Path of Harmony, cannot trigger the \"immediate action\" effect.",
